---
import { url } from "@utils/url-utils";
import MainGridLayout from "@layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

const title = "赞助";
---
<MainGridLayout title={title} description="如果 Server Core Manager 帮到了你，可以请作者喝杯咖啡">
    <div class="flex w-full rounded-[var(--radius-large)] overflow-hidden relative min-h-32">
        <div class="card-base z-10 px-9 py-6 relative w-full">
            <!-- 页面标题 -->
            <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center mb-8">
                <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-black/90 dark:text-white/90 mb-2 relative
                          before:w-1 before:h-8 before:rounded-md before:bg-[var(--primary)]
                          before:absolute before:top-1/2 before:-translate-y-1/2 before:-left-4">
                    {title}
                </h1>
            </div>

            <p class="text-90 leading-relaxed">
                这个工具是免费的、开源的（GPL-3.0），没有任何付费功能，也没有广告。
                如果它确实帮你省下了折腾 Server Core 的时间，可以请作者喝杯咖啡。
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-8 max-w-[620px]">
                <figure class="rounded-[var(--radius-large)] border border-[var(--line-divider)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-3">
                    <img src={url("/images/sponsor/wechat.jpg")} alt="微信赞赏码"
                         width="700" height="565" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                         class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg" />
                    <figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-sm text-50">微信</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <figure class="rounded-[var(--radius-large)] border border-[var(--line-divider)] bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-3">
                    <img src={url("/images/sponsor/alipay.png")} alt="支付宝收款码"
                         width="700" height="1049" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                         class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg" />
                    <figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-sm text-50">支付宝</figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-8 text-sm text-50 leading-relaxed">
                <p>赞助完全自愿，不影响任何功能，也不影响提 issue 的处理顺序 —— 功能和 Bug 都照常修。</p>
                <p class="mt-2">
                    还有更省事的支持方式：把使用体验、踩到的坑写进
                    <a href="https://github.com/OrangeArtc0915/Server-core-manager/issues" target="_blank"
                       rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link text-[var(--primary)] font-medium">Issues</a>，
                    或者告诉身边同样在折腾 Server Core 的人。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</MainGridLayout>
